{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"I fell it’s just really hard to balance everything out because it’s impossible to account for everything. I’ll probably always go back to Pylia because she’s the most broken of all my characters, but given the right epic level build, she would have a such a level of bullshit when it comes to skills like perception, investigation, insight, etc. that basically if she got any sort of boosts to those through would turn any sort of check into a complete joke","created_at":"2021-08-25T18:14:00.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880153055507660800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
